UID:6a47f6a848c98c3600a43f0d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Please note that Hillcrest Library will be closed for renovati
 ons beginning\nMonday\, July 27\, 2026\n\, for approximately four months. 
 The renovation will include essential roof repairs and improvements to the
  accessibility of the library grounds. This program has been cancelled.\nC
 ome on over for a relaxing afternoon of knitting and crocheting. Join the 
 knitting group where you can work on your own crochet and knitting project
 s while enjoying great conversation. We'll swap tips\, techniques\, patter
 ns\, yarns and more!\nPlease note this is not a program where formal instr
 uctions are given. However\, we are happy to learn from each other and hel
 p each other out where we can.\nAll levels are welcome. Bring your own yar
 n\, needles and crochet hooks. Some material may be provided.
LOCATION:Hillcrest\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a47f6a848c98c3600a43f0d
